@lienpolansky @captaindotdev You might find our PII masker relevant! I built it with ProgramAsWeights by compiling an English specification into a neural program for a 0.6B model.
It can run locally on CPU, so the original text can stay on your own machine. We also provide hosted inference if that's easier to integrate. The code and weights are public.
Demo + code: https://t.co/NInwBSsv8o

@ResisttheMS In his haste to direct AI, Elon made a tactical error in going all-in for a closed model.

Closed models keep their code and inner workings private to be managed by Elon.

Business wants Open-source in order to maintain full access to download, modify, and run the system locally.
